<title>USA: RUGBY UNION-WALES BEAT U.S. 28-23.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WALES BEAT U.S. 28-23.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wales beat the United</p>
<p>States 28-23 (halftime 13-6) in a rugby union match on</p>
<p>Saturday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>United States - Tries: Jason Walker, Vaea Anitoni.</p>
<p>Conversions: Matt Alexander (2). Penalty goals: Alexander (3).</p>
<p>Wales - Tries: Wayne Proctor (3), Arwel Thomas.</p>
<p>Conversion: Thomas. Penalty goals: Thomas (2).</p>
</text>
